You are working on the website chamanozap.net.

This project is a high-scale static website (800+ pages) focused on:
- Mobile-first usability with an app-like experience
- High performance and fast loading
- SEO and Google AdSense monetization
- Product reviews and WhatsApp contact pages

The stack is strictly limited to:
- HTML
- CSS
- Vanilla JavaScript

The use of React, any JavaScript framework, backend code, databases, APIs, SSR, SPAs, or client-side frameworks is strictly forbidden.

PUBLIC URL RULES:
- All public pages use flat URLs with semantic prefixes.
- Valid URL patterns are:
  /whatsapp-{slug}
  /review-{slug}
- Examples:
  /whatsapp-expresso-guanabara
  /review-fogao-consul-5-bocas
- Subfolders, query parameters, and file extensions (.html) must never appear in public URLs.

CONTENT AND DATA RULES:
- There is no database.
- All page content is stored in static JSON files:
  /public/data/whatsapp.json
  /public/data/review.json
- Each JSON entry represents one public page.
- Pages must never be created by duplicating HTML files.

TEMPLATE RULES:
- Only two HTML templates are allowed:
  /pages/whatsapp.html
  /pages/review.html
- Templates must load content dynamically from JSON.
- The slug must be extracted from the URL.
- SEO elements (title, meta description, h1) must be injected dynamically.
- The user must never see internal paths, parameters, or template files.

UX AND MOBILE-FIRST RULES:
- All layouts must be designed mobile-first.
- The interface must feel like a mobile application.
- No sidebars, no complex menus, no visual clutter.
- Desktop is only an adaptation of the mobile layout.

BUTTONS AND CTA RULES:
- Buttons are a core business element.
- Every page must include visible call-to-action buttons.
- Buttons must appear above the fold on mobile.
- Minimum button height is 44px.
- High contrast and full clickable area are mandatory.
- Common CTAs include WhatsApp, phone call, and "Saiba mais" or "Site oficial".

SEO RULES (NON-NEGOTIABLE):
- Every page must have a unique <title>.
- Every page must have a unique <meta name="description">.
- Every page must have exactly one <h1>.
- Semantic HTML structure is mandatory.
- Thin content and placeholder text are forbidden.

JAVASCRIPT RULES:
- JavaScript may only be used for:
  - Reading the current URL
  - Loading JSON data
  - Rendering content into templates
  - Small, non-intrusive UI interactions
- JavaScript must never behave as a SPA or break SEO.

PERFORMANCE AND ADSENSE RULES:
- Performance is critical, especially on mobile.
- Heavy libraries, carousels, autoplay videos, and intrusive popups are forbidden.
- Pages must comply with Google AdSense policies.
- Core Web Vitals must remain high.

SCALABILITY PRINCIPLE:
- The project must scale to hundreds of pages without structural changes.
- Adding a new page must require only adding a new entry to a JSON file.

ABSOLUTE PRINCIPLE:
- chamanozap.net is not a traditional website.
- It is a static, scalable, SEO-driven page engine where simplicity, speed, and monetization come before visual complexity.
